Here is the complete, production-grade C++20 implementation of the **Multi-Version Adaptive Radix Tree (MV-ART)** with Optimistic Lock Coupling (OLC), Epoch-Based Memory Reclamation (EBR), and a Lock-Free Group-Committed Write-Ahead Log (WAL).

